  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あっ、先輩！　もう、けっこう待ったんですからね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「早めの待ち合わせ時刻にしておいてよかった～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「今ならまだ、開場時間にも間に合いそうですし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「というか、どうして遅刻したんですかね……いや。別に責めるとか、そういうわけじゃないんですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「いつもはしっかりしてる先輩が、まさかこんなに遅刻してくるなんて、意外だなって思って～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「もしかして、夏休みに入って不規則な生活になっちゃってるとか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「どうしてわかったのか……ですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「だって転校生の先輩、一学期の間は校内を走り回ってたじゃないですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「ふだんからそんなに体力のあるひとが体調を崩すだなんて、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「それこそ病気か夏休みの生活リズムの乱れ、みたいな理由じゃないですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「うん？　無人島に漂流してた、ですか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「んもう。変な冗談やめてくださいよ～♪　そんな非現実的なこと、あるはずがないじゃないですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「そういうのはうちの学校にいる個性的な生徒たちだけでじゅうぶんですからね～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「んじゃ、会場まで行きましょうか。ここの繁華街のバス停から、臨時のシャトルバスが出るみたいで……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「次のバスは、あと十五分後みたいですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「……待ってる間、けっこう暇ですから。何かお話でもしましょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「テーマは……『夏の思い出』とか、どうですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「いやいや、それは二学期に校内放送で『おたより』を募集しようと思って考えてるテーマだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「まだ夏休み半ばだし、さすがに早すぎるっていうか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「え～と、ほかには……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「転校生の先輩って、たしか剣道部の合宿にお邪魔してたんですよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「いちかっちから聞いたんですけど、どんなことがあったか教えてもらっていいですか～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「んん？　もう島には流されたくない……ですか？　また無人島の話？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「島の先住民に気絶させられた？　そのあと、なんやかんやあってクルーザーで合宿上に戻ってきた……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「いやいや……さすがに信じませんからね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あたしをからかおうったって、そんな話はありえないですから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「新聞部やオカ研なら、そういう『キナ臭い』事件を調査するんでしょうけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「そ、そういえば。夏フェスに一緒に行く予定だったのって、誰だったんでしょうか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「先輩の、彼女さんとか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あはは。なんて、そんなこと聞くのも野暮ったいですよね。いまのは聞かなかったことにしてください♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「なしなし！　言わなくてよし！　あたしは何も言わなかったので！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "「あっ、そういえばこのバンド、日本にはじめて来日するらしいんですよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（……な、なんか強引に話題を変えちゃったけど。よかったよね……）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（う～む？　予想以上にテンパっちゃってるなぁ、あたし？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（この調子で、転校生の先輩と夏フェスを楽しめるんだろ～か？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 40,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（弱気になっても、しかたがないよね。もともとあたしは勢いだけで突っ走ってきたわけだし……）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（それに、こんなところで勝手に心折れてたら、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（転校生の先輩も、あたしのことを二度と誘ってくれなくなるかもしれないよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みさき",
    "text": "（せっかく誘ってくれたんだ。先輩には、ちゃんと楽しんでもらわなくちゃ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
